  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Unit vector in the direction of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
